  "eventID": 206158236,
  "template": "Generic UW Event",
  "title": "I will carry you over on my back: 2026 Fall MFA Show",
  "description": "<em><em>I will carry you over on my back</em></em>, this year&#8217;s iteration of our annual fall MFA show, meditates on accumulation, the underground, labor &amp; capacity, and the movement of systems and objects toward loss, disrepair, and failure. Spanning performance, installation, sound art, and found object sculpture, we look forward to sharing all that Jayden Dukes, Gaeun Kim, Cameron McGaff, and Skye Amber O&#8217;Brien have been working on.<br /><br /><br />Paired with the exhibition, the cohort has produced a publication featured a commissioned essay by Troy Sherman. The publication will printed in an edition of 300 and will be available for free in the gallery.",
