  "eventID": 209063433,
  "template": "Generic UW Event",
  "title": "[EXHIBIT] Treasures of the Tateuchi East Asia Library: Preserving the Past, Inspiring the Future",
  "description": "In celebration of the Tateuchi East Asia Library&#8217;s 90th Anniversary in 2027, this exhibition showcases remarkable treasures from TEAL&#8217;s collections, including rare books, manuscripts, maps, woodblocks, musical scores, and newly acquired materials. Discover the rich histories and cultures of East Asia and the story of TEAL&#8217;s nearly nine decades of collecting and preserving knowledge.<br /><br />**<strong><strong> There will be a hands-on workshop led by the Tateuchi East Asia Librarians on February 10, 2027</strong></strong>. If you are interested in attending, please register via <a href=\"https://lib.uw.edu/about/news-events/calendar/?trumbaEmbed=view%3Devent%26eventid%3D209063558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">this page</a>.",
