  "description": "The UWCFD is delighted to once again offer our holiday evergreen sale, benefiting our 2026 featured nonprofit, <a href=\"https://hr.uw.edu/cfd/annual-campaign/2026-featured-nonprofit-american-cancer-society/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">American Cancer Society.</a><br /><br />Show your support this season with the purchase of a beautiful evergreen wreath or door swag. Choose one or more of these beauties and your order will help make the world a little brighter for a neighbor in need. Items will be available for pick up on campus the first full week of December or can be shipped directly to your home.<br /><br />Place your order by November 8, 2026:",
